    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/6aa41aa9877842dc0c27eca66d2e2ae6.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/6aa41aa9877842dc0c27eca66d2e2ae6.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/6aa41aa9877842dc0c27eca66d2e2ae6.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><i>Hyperspaced</i> is a chaotic co-op space action game for 1-4 players. Working as a team, you and your fellow Space Cadets must save the Multiverse from collapsing. Slide into the pilot\u2019s seat, operate turrets, become a mechanic or even a janitor on your quest to find the culprit who disturbed the balance of the Multiverse.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/071c37080f8e1c8dbd162251ec954691.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/071c37080f8e1c8dbd162251ec954691.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/071c37080f8e1c8dbd162251ec954691.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">THE MULTIVERSE IS IN DANGER</h2><br>The Multiverse is in danger! Some wacko stole multiple Great Plugs, which are items of great importance that bind the many universes together. Without the plugs, anyone can traverse the different galaxies via a series of pipes. However, if the pipes are left open, the plug-less galaxy will slowly die and disappear. <br><br>S.H.E.L.D.O.N., your sassy on-board A.I. guides you on your quest to find the thief and bring back balance to the Multiverse! Along the way, you may meet a bunch of other intergalactic travellers in dire need of help. A mysterious drone, an odd hermit, a merchant space octopus... and cats?! <br><br>Helping them is up to you; who knows, they might join your perilous adventure. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/c9f7637fdfabaf26d8ecede3bc3e5497.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/c9f7637fdfabaf26d8ecede3bc3e5497.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/c9f7637fdfabaf26d8ecede3bc3e5497.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LIFE ON BOARD</h2><br>Fresh out of the Space Academy, you or a team of up to 4 Space Cadets must pilot, shoot turrets, extinguish fires, clean up, repair, recycle and re-enforce your ship with upgrades while swarms of enemies bombard you with vicious attacks. <br><br>With an inner and outer split-screen view of the ship, multitasking, and good teamwork are key to success and crucial in the hardest difficulties. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/7f3adf011f80b10c92e04d362c4ba840.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/7f3adf011f80b10c92e04d362c4ba840.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/7f3adf011f80b10c92e04d362c4ba840.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">EVERY RUN IS UNIQUE FOR INFINITE FUN</h2><br>The Multiverse in <i>Hyperspaced</i> is procedurally generated, making every run unique! Regardless of whether or not you choose to try out a new spacecraft or module, it will always be a brand-new adventure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/98bcd05b144f98abf77dbb86919a265f.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/98bcd05b144f98abf77dbb86919a265f.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/98bcd05b144f98abf77dbb86919a265f.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNLOCK NEW VESSELS</h2>A variety of abandoned ships lie scattered around the Multiverse. Repair them to their former glory and get ready for a whole new ride as each offers distinctly different play styles for your crew! Some vessels are larger with more module slots and cargo space. Others are smaller, faster, and more agile, but offer fewer slots and cargo space. <br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/56ca2c7953b1dc67dcd1cbd18bb9f634.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/56ca2c7953b1dc67dcd1cbd18bb9f634.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/56ca2c7953b1dc67dcd1cbd18bb9f634.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DISCOVER NEW MODULES</h2>Find and unlock new modules and discover crazy new weapons, defences, and other tools. Upgrade them from your hub and prepare your ship for epic boss battles! <br><br><br>But most importantly, don\u2019t forget to pet Scrappy! He is always hungry and will convert any item or junk you feed him into scraps that can be used to buy things while you are on a mission. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/79c9d8f891f9d464863c16fe85c14300.poster.avif?t=1753196740\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/79c9d8f891f9d464863c16fe85c14300.webm?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1125830/extras/79c9d8f891f9d464863c16fe85c14300.mp4?t=1753196740\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HOW TO PLAY WITH CREWMATES FROM ANOTHER GALAXY </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> With Parsec: <strong>Parsec </strong>is an external tool used to <strong>stream your computer screen</strong> to your mates, while they can use their own controllers for the game. It\u2019s an easy way to play with your friends! (Fun fact: We even used it while developing the game from the home office!) <br><br>\u2003\u20031. Open Parsec. You\u2019ll all need your own account. <br>\u2003\u20032. Add your friends to your friends list. <br>\u2003\u20033. Your friends can now see your computer and ask for permission to join! <br>\u2003\u20034. Start your game on Steam and let the fun begin! <br><br></li><li> With <strong>Steam Remote Play Together</strong>: Steam Remote Play Together <strong>streams your game</strong> and doesn\u2019t require any external tool. <br><br>\u2003\u20031. Open Steam. You\u2019ll all need your own account. <br>\u2003\u20032. Open \u201cHyperspaced\u201d. <br>\u2003\u20033. Two options: <br>\u2003\u2003\u2003- Open the Steam Overlay (Ctrl+Shift), right click on your friend\u2019s name in the friends list and select \u201cInvite to Remote Play together\u201d. <br>\u2003\u2003\u2003- In the pause menu of \u201cHyperspaced\u201d, select \u201cInvite Friends\u201d and select them from your friends list. </li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>1-4 players \u2013 local co-op &amp; support for Parsec and Steam Remote Play Together<br></li><li>Super easy to drop in a run at any time<br></li><li>Simple controls<br></li><li>Manage the inside of your ship while you try to survive the harsh outside world, simultaneously!<br></li><li>Infinite replayability: Procedurally generated maps, different modules, ships for different playstyles, and a whole bunch of things to discover!</li></ul>",
